  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Anvansa San Activity</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Atividade da Anvansa San</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">A Atividade Avansa San visa fortalecer o sistema alimentar, aumentando a oferta e a procura de alimentos que comp&#xF5;em dietas saud&#xE1;veis, especialmente para mulheres e crian&#xE7;as.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Avansa San Activity is designed to strengthen the food system by increasing the supply and demand of foods that comprise healthy diets, particularly for women and children.</narrative>
  </description>
